# Kazimir & Megan wedding website

## Where to edit

- Everyday config (passwords, dates, emails, playlists, `cloudUrl`): `src/config/settings.js`
- Page copy: `src/pages/<route>.html` (keep `id="page-..."`, `class="page"`, and any `data-tier`)
- Photos: `public/images_*.jpg` — see `docs/PHOTO-CHECKLIST.md`
- Behaviour: `src/js/` (boot orchestrator is `src/js/app.js`)
- Editable lists (party, quiz, Connie KB, map pins): `src/data/`

## Architecture

- Vite + vanilla JS. Dev: `npm run dev`. Build: `npm run build` → `dist/`.
- Hash SPA: `#home`, `#rsvp`, etc. Router and tier pruning live in `src/js/app.js` / `src/js/tier.js`.
- Three guest tiers: `full`, `vinko`, `afterparty`. Elements with `data-tier` are removed if the unlocked tier is not listed.
- Optional backend: `backend/Code.gs` (Google Apps Script). `SETTINGS.cloudKey` must match `SECRET_KEY`.

## Do not

- Do not treat gate passwords as real security; do not add secrets beyond the existing gate/cloud-key model without an explicit request.
- Do not rewrite to React/Next unless asked.
- Prefer updating placeholders (`PLACEHOLDER`) and content over drive-by refactors.
